      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HECTIC HARRY (5) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 3 length third (22.74) over 390m at this track. Must come into calculations. TWILIGHT AXLE (1) is a fast beginner who has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 3rd at this track over 450m. Will give a great sight again. DEMONIC SPIRIT (2) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 5 winner three back (17.14) at Healesville over 300m. Well placed here and should do much better. ASTON KATY (7) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
